# Atlantic AI — Day 1 Practice Project

## Project Overview

This is my Day 1 practice project for the Atlantic AI project.

The goal was to practice Python fundamentals by building a simple course-search bot that reads course information from a JSON file and allows the user to search for a course using its course code.

